  "metadata": {
    "id": "silo_complex",
    "name": "Silo Complex",
    "author": "ChronoSplit",
    "description": "A buried silo complex in the spirit of GoldenEye's Complex: one vast two-storey floor of pillars and crates, a catwalk ring a storey up, and a loop of concrete rooms and corridors with doorways in from all four sides. Open stairs climb to the catwalk landings; the railgun sits on the north landing, heavy armour on the south, and the auto shotgun in the dead centre of the floor.",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z",
